lass=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3079/307904/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3079/307904/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3079/307904/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3079/307904/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307904\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307907.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3b/Belonging-307907.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">明光之于黄金<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">As Radiance Is to Gold</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7200<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>仿古波斯风格的黄金饰品，形似翼羽，色如明光。在问及其价值时，受访者称：“它并非此次出行中最为贵重之物。”在我们追问何为更贵重之物时，受访者展示了一份尚未完成的复原手稿。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307908.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/15/Belonging-307908.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">冷火之于信徒<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">As Flame Is to Faith</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一簇跃动于受访者右臂的火焰，留存其洁净之形，抛却其灼烧之苦。<br />对于“这是否算是一种置身其中的智慧”的提问，受访者不置可否。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307909.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/15/Belonging-307909.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">明灭之于花朵<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">As Bloom Is to Spring</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />21<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一盏留有少量余蜡的烛台。受访者将其点燃，又复而将其熄灭。<br />“重要的并非火焰本身，就本质而言，这簇火焰与千年之前的火焰并无区别；焚毁此地的火焰，也与为此地所赞颂的火焰并无不同。”</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=